{"id":77714,"slug":"vra-dy-v-midsomeru-1997","title":"Vraždy v Midsomeru","title_en":"Midsomer Murders","year":1997,"rating":69,"votes_count":13203,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Šéfinspektor Barnaby a seržant Nelson vyšetřují smrt ženy, která byla zavražděna během dobročinné akce ve venkovském kostele. Nebyla to ledajaká akce, ale kouzelnická show iluzionisty Gedeona Latimera. A oběť, bytná Hannah Altman, mu během jeho představení asistovala. Byla Hannah tím pravým terčem, nebo si vrah vybral iluzionistu a jen mu to nevyšlo? Indicií k plánované vraždě kouzelníka by mohly být výhrůžné dopisy, které dostával a které ho vinily ze satanismu. Nehlasitějším kritikem, byl vikář Andrew Maplin. Motiv by se zdál jednoduchý, kdyby nebyl vikář nalezen mrtvý na kamenném pohanském oltáři. Navíc se ukáže se, že jeho manželka Lorna Soane je potomek satanistů z 18. století.(TV Prima)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/159/116/159116907_79ba98.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Krimi","Drama","Mysteriózní"],"tags":["vražda","vyšetřování","vrah","detektiv","whodunit"],"countries":["Velká Británie"],"directors":["Baz Taylor","David Tucker","Sarah Hellings","Renny Rye","Peter Smith","Charlie Palmer","Steve Hughes","Simon Langton","Nicholas Laughland","Alex Pillai","Andy Hay","Rob Evans","Matt Carter","Moira Armstrong","Audrey Cooke","Paul Harrison","Jeremy Silberston","Toby Frow","Jennie Darnell","Luke Watson","Roberto Bangura","Christine Lalla","Gill Wilkinson","Leon Lopez","Paul Gibson","Peter Cregeen"],"actors":["John Nettles","Jason Hughes","Daniel Casey","Jane Wymark","Rowena Cooper","Phyllida Law","Nick Moran","Emily Mortimer","Laura Howard","Julian Glover","Trudie Styler","Tamzin Malleson","Judy Parfitt","Jessica Hynes","Christopher Villiers","Toby Jones","Tom Frederic","Timothy Bateson","Annabelle Apsion","John Shrapnel","Clare Holman","Charles Kay","Eamon