cey Ainsworth","George Innes","Gerda Stevenson","James Laurenson","Ann Queensberry","Malcolm Tierney","Kirsty Dillon","Bernard Gallagher","Tanya Fear","Manjinder Virk","Tom York","Ian Puleston-Davies","Susannah Wise","Ian Peck","Ian Mann","Stirling Gallacher","Andrew Buckley","Richard Price","Clive Dancey","Richard Hope","Sam Beazley","James Lance","Nicholas Le Prevost","Mark Armstrong","Michael Fitzgerald","Sheena Bhattessa","Tom Rooke","Nikesh Patel","Robert Morgan","Tilly Blackwood","Christopher Colquhoun","Alan Williams","Nick Fletcher","Geoffrey Streatfeild","Jane Booker","Pearce Quigley","Lloyd Hutchinson","Geoffrey Beevers","Hugh Ross","Lucy Phelps","Nigel Betts","Chris Wilson","Emma Stansfield","Kate Miles","Gareth Thomas","Edwin Thomas","Frank Mills","Abigail Thaw","Matti Houghton","Sophie Stone","Tony Gardner","Hari Dhillon","Amanda Walker","Daniel Hill","Annette Badland","Michael Byrne","Anita Harris","Adrian Mitchell","Anjli Mohindra","Elaine Paige","Ray Fearon","Ella Kenion","John Light","Niamh McGrady","Dorothy Atkinson","Neil McCaul","Bill Bailey","Ruby Bentall","Nicholas Burns","Ben Caplan","Jemma Redgrave","Elena Saurel","Ellen Thomas","Heather Wright","Tamzin Outhwaite","Richard Rankin","Camilla Arfwedson","Kelly Brook","Michael Fox","Liz Fraser","Gabrielle Glaister","Colin McFarlane","Fenella Woolgar","Lorraine Ashbourne","Lorraine Burroughs","Kevin Eldon","Andrew Gower","Mike Grady","Joni Kamen","Andrew Knott","Terence Maynard","Jason Watkins","Amanda Lawrence","Ella Balinska","Don Gilet","Paul Putner","Pamela Betsy Cooper","Ginny Dee","Shaun Lucas","Jon Wennington","Kelvin Wise","Chance Perdomo","Les Dennis","Simon Dutton","Mark Benton","Amber Aga","Joe Sims","Jeffry Wickham","Benedick Blythe","Caroline Faber","Olly Rix","Dominic Rowan","Oliver Lavery-Farag","Sara Powell","Jessica Turner"],"screenwriters":["Caroline Graham","Michael Aitkens","Anthony Horowitz","Barry Simner","Nicholas Martin","Douglas Watkinson","Paul Logue","J. C. Wilsher","Hugh Whitemore","Jeff Povey","Michael Crompton","Peter Hammond","Nicholas Hicks-Beach","Chris Murray","Julia Gilbert","Douglas Livingstone","Helen Jenkins","Barry Purchese","Lisa Holdsworth","Caleb Ranson","Terry Hodgkinson","Jeremy Paul","Andrew Payne","Maria Ward","Rachel Cuperman","Sally Griffiths","Tony Etchells","Alan Plater"],"cinematographers":["Colin Munn","Graham Frake","Chris O'Dell","Andy Hollis","Chris Preston","Al Beech","James Moss","Steve Saunderson","Doug Hallows"],"composers":["Jim Parker","Evan Jolly"],"reviews":[{"author":"gabin(a)","text":"Aneb čtyři vraždy nestačí, drahoušku! Ještěže je Midsomer fiktivní, jinak by tam museli nasadit jednotky OSN. Míra vražednosti tam hraničí s genocidou:-). Perfektní detektivky starého dobrého anglického střihu. Barnaby je samozřejmě ideální muž pozorný k vlastní ženě (však je taky výtvorem ženy). Suchý humor, který ještě vylepšují upoutávky na Primě (Kupte si dům v Midsomeru.....). Zvláště scény z manželského života jsou pro nás starší manžele třešničkou na dortu, hlavně pokud jde o Joycino kulinářské umění (Seržant Scott s plnou pusou a koláčkem v ruce: \"Dobré, to pekla Vaše žena?\" Barnaby:\"Blázníš,? To bych Ti nikdy neudělal!!!\"). A ta hudba! Vlastně valčíček v různých modifikacích (hororová melodie, dětský sbor, amatérští hudebníci). A ty figury, zvláště staré čarodénice (jak říká můj otec)! No nic, to už stačí, dneska je premiéra dalšího dílu, už se těším!(12.01.2010)","stars":5},{"author":"MáŠa","text":"Díky Primě taková klasika pro víkendový podvečer. Jde to, ale najdou se i lepší dílka. Dělám si z toho trošku srandu, že být to skutečné, tak už v Midsomeru nikdo nežije, protože se tam všichni vyvraždili. Často jsou vrahy různí blázni, že to působí až nevěrohodně. Občas se v dílech objeví nějaký ten vtípek, možná by jich tam mohlo být i o něco víc. Mít to jen jednu sérii, tak bych tu nechal vyšší hodnocení, ale s tímhle počtem epizod se seriál po čase chtě nechtě omrzel a zprůměrnil(07.12.2013)","stars":3},{"author":"PROCESOR","text":"Vůbec mě to nebaví, je to vždy příšerně dlouhý rozvleklý a dohromady se nic neděje. Za ty léta už tam nemaj koho vraždit ,tak ještě, že jim ty stavy doplněj uprchlíci. Ale já anglický detektivky nikdy nemusel. Ani toho malýho Belgičana co tak cupitá-Hercule Poirot. I když ten měl některý epizody dobrý a na ten průměr dosáhne. Kde sou ty časy, kdy David Suchet hrál v roce 1977 v epizodě Profesionálové drsného teroristu.....No tak to jsme vzali jedním vrzem hned 2 seriály.(20.08.2015)","stars":1}],"vods":[{"platform":"prima+","url":"https://www.iprima.cz/serialy/vrazdy-v-midsomeru-1?utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=section_vod&utm_campaign=link_exchange"},{"platform":"JOJ Play","url":"https://play.joj.sk/series/UhBJDC6CmF4dsOxZs3X8"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/111844-vrazdy-v-midsomeru/prehled/","root_id":111844,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":26,"episode_count":148,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2022-12-12","last_vod_date":"2025-12-29","episodes":[{"season_no":23,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2022-12-12","title":"Proroctví z Černého lesa (S23E01)","platforms":["Acorn TV"]},{"season_no":23,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2022-12-19","title":"Pavučina lží (S23E02)","platforms":["Acorn TV"]},{"season_no":23,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2022-12-26","title":"Zrnko pravdy (S23E03)","platforms":["Acorn TV"]},{"season_no":23,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2023-01-02","title":"Královna na zabití (S23E04)","platforms":["Acorn TV"]},{"season_no":25,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2025-12-08","title":"Poklady z temnot (S25E01)","platforms":["Acorn TV"]},{"season_no":25,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2025-12-15","title":"Hřiště mrtvých (S25E02)","platforms":["Acorn TV"]},{"season_no":25,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2025-12-22","title":"Smrt odbije třikrát (S25E03)","platforms":["Acorn TV"]},{"season_no":25,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2025-12-29","title":"Nejle